# 'осталось' is this locale's own word for the time that remains: it is the
# word timer_status.dialog already speaks, На таймере {name} осталось {remaining}.
# 'слева' below is the DIRECTION left and does not belong here. It is kept
# so no phrasing is lost until a speaker removes it. Both lines unvouched.
осталось
готово
длинный
заканчивается
конец
слева
статус
